cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Artifice Suite"
abstract: >-
  A collection of local-first, bring-your-own-model (BYOM) desktop tools for
  historians: OCR (artifice-ocr), copy editing (artifice-draft), knowledge
  graph extraction (artifice-graph), and oral history transcription
  (artifice-transcribe), built around structured model-interaction harnesses
  rather than freeform chat interfaces.
type: software
authors:
